  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">I-LEAD (Indigenous Women and Girls - Leadership and Empowerment in Ancestral Domains)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Indigenous Women and Girls - Leadership and Empowerment in Ancestral Domains (I-LEAD) Project will be implemented through three linked components: (i) Strengthening Ancestral Domain Governance with Human Rights and Gender Perspectives; (ii) Promoting Gender-Equitable and Culturally Appropriate Economic Empowerment; and (iii) Enhancing the Capacity of the NCIP and other Stakeholders on Human Rights-Based, Gender Responsive, and Culturally Appropriate Policy Development and Knowledge Managemen</narrative>
  </description>
